    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d472">

                <pb facs="0439" n="323" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg323"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.7111/52.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Page to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 23, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>My February 21. Sir Edward Grey requests me to add the information that the
                    Governor of the Gold Coast Colony telegraphs to the effect that the leases Sam
                    is said to have acquired in the Colony have not been registered here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Page</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
